d/50503016/indiana-starting-guard-brunner-season-acl-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NC State hires Jatavis Sanders as GM under Philip Rivers","description":"NC State has hired Jatavis Sanders as its general manager under new coach Philip Rivers, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T16:33:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502157/nc-state-hires-jatavis-sanders-gm-philip-rivers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"ACC suspends Louisville LB Clark, UNC DB Smith over postgame brawl","description":"The ACC has suspended Louisville LB Stanquan Clark and North Carolina DB Greg Smith III, while also issuing fines and public reprimands to both schools in the wake of Saturday's postgame brawl.","published":"2026-11-16T16:19:01.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502075/louisville-lb-clark-unc-db-smith-suspended-postgame-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan top WR JJ Buchanan (shoulder) likely out for season","description":"Michigan's leading receiver JJ Buchanan will likely miss the rest of the season after he sustained a shoulder injury in Saturday's loss at No. 16 Oregon.","published":"2026-11-16T16:30:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502065/michigan-top-wr-jj-buchanan-shoulder-likely-season","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-16T16:00:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UTEP fires head coach Scotty Walden following 8th straight loss","description":"The UTEP Miners, just 1-9 this season and mired in an eight-game losing streak, have fired head coach Scotty Walden, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T15:13:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50501672/utep-1-9-season-fires-coach-walden-8th-straight-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-16T14:25:23.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T13:48:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026-27 Week 11 College Football Playoff, bowl projections","description":"Our bowl gurus take a look at how the postseason picture shifted after Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:28:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50473016/2026-week-11-college-football-playoff-bowl-projections","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura and Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football takeaways: Lasting impressions from Week 11","description":"Our college football experts break down the most important things they saw in Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:21:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/mondaytakeaways111626/2026-college-football-takeaways-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4833626/ben-roberts","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Roberts_(linebacker)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Ben Roberts (linebacker)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Roberts_(linebacker)","description":"American football player (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:26Z","intro":"Ben Roberts (born February 28, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the Texas Tech Red Raiders.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Roberts attended V.R. Eaton High School. He committed to play college football for the Texas Tech Red Raiders."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Roberts used the 2022 season to redshirt. In week two of the 2023 season, Roberts made his first career start, where he notched 12 tackles with two being for a loss, half a sack, and a forced fumble in a loss versus Oregon. He finished the 2023 season, recording a team-high 107 tackles with six and a half being for a loss, half a sack, an interception, and two forced fumbles. For his performance during the 2023 season, Roberts was named to the FWAA freshman all-American team, while also being named the Big 12 Defensive Freshman of the Year. He finished the 2024 season, notching 83 tackles with four and a half going for a loss. In week eleven of the 2025 season, Roberts brought in an interception in a victory versus Kansas State.\nTeaming up at linebacker with Big XII defensive Most Valuable Player Jacob Rodriguez, Roberts led the Red Raiders to a 34–7 win over BYU in the conference championship game on Dec. 6 at Cowboys Stadium. Roberts tallied two interceptions in the second half and was named the game’s MVP."}]}}